---
// 3.1 — Test with real data: data type coverage grid
---

<div class="datagrid-wrap">
  <div class="datagrid-label">TEST DATASET COVERAGE</div>
  <div class="datagrid">
    <div class="data-tile tile-ok">
      <div class="tile-icon">🧬</div>
      <div class="tile-name">Paired-end<br />short-read</div>
    </div>
    <div class="data-tile tile-ok">
      <div class="tile-icon">🔬</div>
      <div class="tile-name">Single-end<br />short-read</div>
    </div>
    <div class="data-tile tile-ok">
      <div class="tile-icon">📏</div>
      <div class="tile-name">Long-read<br />(ONT / PacBio)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="data-tile tile-ok">
      <div class="tile-icon">🗜️</div>
      <div class="tile-name">Gzipped<br />FASTQ</div>
    </div>
    <div class="data-tile tile-ok">
      <div class="tile-icon">📊</div>
      <div class="tile-name">Large files<br />&gt;100 GB</div>
    </div>
    <div class="data-tile tile-ok">
      <div class="tile-icon">🔹</div>
      <div class="tile-name">Small / sparse<br />files</div>
    </div>
    <div class="data-tile tile-ok">
      <div class="tile-icon">⚠️</div>
      <div class="tile-name">Edge cases<br />&amp; malformed</div>
    </div>
    <div class="data-tile tile-ok">
      <div class="tile-icon">🏥</div>
      <div class="tile-name">Multi-sample<br />cohorts</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="datagrid-note">
    Synthetic data cannot replicate the quirks of real sequencers. Always test on real data from real experiments.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .datagrid-wrap {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .datagrid-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .datagrid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(110px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .data-tile {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-sm);
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .tile-ok {
    border-color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.15);
    background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.03);
  }

  .tile-icon {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .tile-name {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .datagrid-note {
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    padding-top: var(--space-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
